### Variabel Environment
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create User
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "johndoe",
    "password": "secret123",
    "full_name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

### Get User
GET {{host}}/users/johndoe

### Create Account
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "owner": "johndoe",
    "currency": "USD"
}

### Get Account by ID
GET {{host}}/accounts/1

### List Accounts
GET {{host}}/accounts?page_id=1&page_size=5

### Create Transfer
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": 1,
    "to_account_id": 2,
    "amount": 10,
    "currency": "USD"
}
